#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Launch/Creating-Launch-Files.rst:18
msgid ""
"Launch files make it easier to start ROS systems that contain multiple nodes "
"and configuration details. This article shows how to create and run a launch "
"file for a turtlesim mimic system. After you follow these steps, you can "
"launch multiple configured nodes with a single ``ros launch`` command"
msgstr ""

